{"id":"658766","name":"烧百叶包","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/658766/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"薄百叶","amount":"128克"},{"name":"肉末","amount":"275克"}],"sub":[{"name":"香葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：薄百叶、肉末、香葱、面糊。","img":"images/658766/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"在肉末中加适量的料酒。","img":"images/658766/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加适量的酱油。","img":"images/658766/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加适量的盐。","img":"images/658766/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"调味拌匀。","img":"images/658766/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将薄百叶放在案板上用剪刀剪开。","img":"images/658766/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入大盆里用开水泡一下。","img":"images/658766/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"随后，将泡好的千张放在案板上放上拌好的肉末。","img":"images/658766/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"包起来抹的面糊。","img":"images/658766/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"像包春卷一样包好。","img":"images/658766/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"起锅倒油烧热，下入包好的百叶包两面煎一下。","img":"images/658766/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"然后，加适量的清水。","img":"images/658766/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加适量的油。","img":"images/658766/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"加适量的盐。","img":"images/658766/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"加适量的零卡糖。","img":"images/658766/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"调味烧煮15分钟左右。","img":"images/658766/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"最后，搁入香葱即成。","img":"images/658766/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}